  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "# Issue:\nWhile an Avatar is loading in your Menu the Performance Stats will show the info of the Avatar you had selected before. When it's done loading it will show the correct details.\nThis can be confusing when quickly going through Avatars without waiting for them to load and can result in people think they have the wrong performance stats.\n# Suggestion:\nWhile still loading the new Avatar Performance Stats and Details it should display `N/A` or `Loading` to make it more clear that that information isn't available yet. \n# Attachments:\nHere is a video showcasing the issue: https://streamable.com/hk8twe",
